  m_text: '<b>VR:</b> grab the flashlight (grip) and pull the trigger for light.
    Point at buttons and pull the trigger (or poke them).

    Cameras: front rail.  
    Door: back rail.   Panic: do the 6-7 with both controllers (once per night).

    <b>Desktop:</b>
    mouse aims, click/F = light, right-drag = look, 1-4 = cameras, Tab = monitor,
    Space = door, 6 7 6 7 = panic.'
